 loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/7bc8bc02019d24ee24fa2b2452319d2d.poster.avif?t=1761009354\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/7bc8bc02019d24ee24fa2b2452319d2d.webm?t=1761009354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/7bc8bc02019d24ee24fa2b2452319d2d.mp4?t=1761009354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four-team mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/cae4b044de955e0cd5f20bce6ba772ff.poster.avif?t=1761009354\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/cae4b044de955e0cd5f20bce6ba772ff.webm?t=1761009354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/cae4b044de955e0cd5f20bce6ba772ff.mp4?t=1761009354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space two-team mode:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/1422c178a9299dd09c7b8b289552804e.poster.avif?t=1761009354\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/1422c178a9299dd09c7b8b289552804e.webm?t=1761009354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962520/extras/1422c178a9299dd09c7b8b289552804e.mp4?t=1761009354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space three-team m